OL,3,GNEWSANew conviction extends jailed
OL,4,Arapist's sentence
OL,5,
OL,6,FA convicted sex offender who was jailed
OL,7,Ffor 22 years has had his sentence
OL,8,Fextended after another victim came
OL,9,Fforward.
OL,11,FBrian Guest from Aldridge in Walsall
OL,12,Fwas jailed in 2024 for multiple rapes
OL,13,Fand sexual assaults against women and
OL,14,Fchildren spanning nearly four decades,
OL,15,Fwhich police called "an appalling
OL,16,Fsequence of abuse".
OL,18,FFollowing his conviction, it emerged
OL,19,Fanother woman had been subjected to
OL,20,FGuest's offending when she was child.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
