OL,4,Arapist's sentence
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn connection, the 67-year-old was
OL,7,Ffound guilty of indecent assault of a
OL,8,Fgirl under the age of 14, at a court
OL,9,Fhearing in July and has since had his
OL,10,Fsentence extended by two years and six
OL,11,Fmonths.
